{"root":"kuning","ipa":"/ku.nɪŋ/","core":"黄色，指颜色或指代某些特定事物（如姜黄）。","pos":["形容词","名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ku.nɪŋ/","zh":"黄色","phrases":[{"t":"kuning langsat","zh":"浅黄色（常形容皮肤白皙）"},{"t":"kuning emas","zh":"金黄色"},{"t":"bendera kuning","zh":"黄旗（印尼传统上表示有人去世）"}],"examples":[{"t":"Bunga itu berwarna kuning cerah.","zh":"那朵花是明黄色的。"},{"t":"Dia memakai baju kuning hari ini.","zh":"他今天穿了一件黄色的衣服。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"kuning","ipa":"/ku.nɪŋ/","zh":"黄色","phrase":{"t":"kuning telur","zh":"蛋黄"},"example":{"t":"Warna kuning melambangkan keceriaan.","zh":"黄色象征着快乐。"}},{"w":"kekuningan","ipa":"/kə.ku.nɪ.ŋan/","zh":"发黄的，带黄色的","phrase":{"t":"daun kekuningan","zh":"发黄的叶子"},"example":{"t":"Wajahnya tampak kekuningan karena sakit.","zh":"因为生病，他的脸色看起来发黄。"}},{"w":"menguning","ipa":"/mə.ŋu.nɪŋ/","zh":"变黄，呈现黄色","phrase":{"t":"padi menguning","zh":"稻谷变黄（成熟）"},"example":{"t":"Sawah mulai menguning saat musim panen tiba.","zh":"收获季节到来时，稻田开始变黄。"}},{"w":"menguningkan","ipa":"/mə.ŋu.nɪŋ.kan/","zh":"使变黄","phrase":{"t":"menguningkan kertas","zh":"使纸张变黄"},"example":{"t":"Sinar matahari yang terik menguningkan rumput di halaman.","zh":"强烈的阳光使院子里的草变黄了。"}}],"derSlugs":["kuning","kekuningan","menguning","menguningkan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-27T16:45:12.988Z","src":"base"}